sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title ChalkTalk login flow

    actor User
    participant Frontend as React frontend
    participant WebServer as Express web server
    participant Database as PostgreSQL

    User->>Frontend: Submit email and password
    Frontend->>WebServer: POST /api/v1/sessions
    WebServer->>WebServer: Validate request and rate limit
    WebServer->>Database: Find active user by normalized email
    Database-->>WebServer: User record
    WebServer->>WebServer: Verify password
    WebServer->>WebServer: Generate session and CSRF secrets
    WebServer->>Database: Insert 30-day session
    Database-->>WebServer: Session created
    WebServer-->>Frontend: 201 Created
    Note over Frontend,WebServer: Set secure, HttpOnly session cookie<br/>Return session details and CSRF token<br/>Cache-Control: no-store
    Frontend->>Frontend: Browser stores cookie; app stores CSRF
    Frontend-->>User: Show authenticated application
